--// R6 Rig - drivable local puppet + server copy streamed via SyncMove
--//
--//  local  : real R6 rig (Motor6D joints + Humanoid + Animator), client-only.
--//  server : 6 F3X parts (CreatePart -> EscalateEvent claim -> props), anchored.
--//  bridge : every Heartbeat each local limb's world CFrame -> its server part via
--//           batched SyncMove, fire-and-forget (never waits on the reply).
--//
--//  IDLE mode  : rig stands beside you, GUI plays emotes, "Mirror" copies your pose.
--//  PILOT mode : YOU drive the rig - WASD walk, Shift run, Space jump, camera follows,
--//               animations auto-play from Humanoid state. Your real char is frozen.
--//
--//  (F3X spawns BaseParts only, so the server rig has no Humanoid - it just follows
--//   the local rig's pose frame by frame.)

